invite.text:
{inviter} added you to Pretty Please Print — drop an .stl or .3mf and it goes up on the rail as a ticket.

Claim your seat: {url}

The link works once and expires in {days, plural, one {# day} other {# days}}.

reset.text:
Someone with the keys to the printer reset your Pretty Please Print password.

Choose a new one: {url}

The link works once and expires in {minutes, plural, one {# minute} other {# minutes}}. It does not sign you in — you pick a password, then use it. If you did not expect this, say so before you use it.
